   "html": "<p>For their debut on the SXSW stage, TikTok engaged IHC to produce a full day’s worth of conference style events with a dining experience, speakers, influencer gifting and a late night party.</p>\n<p>The day kicked off with an exclusive marketers brunch, where TikTok team members educated industry professionals on the platform’s live capabilities and best practices for engaging with creators. At night, the space transitioned into a vibrant party with live performances and an interactive creator marketplace, showcasing different creators and the joy and talent TikTok cultivates.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "#ShopTok Night Market",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Inspired by 90s mall shapes and designed with a Gen Z sensibility, we built creator kiosks that with a fun minimalist design for creators to display their unique and handmade products. @marketbotany had an abundance of plants, @speckledbrownie brought her custom pottery and DIY kits, @alilscribble provided her unique drawings and prints, and @thundervoicehatco had handmade hats and blankets. Guests were invited to browse the stalls, interact with the creators, and take home products from each -- dubbing what many called “the best swag bag at SXSW!”</p>"
    },
