  {
   "title": "TikTok in Action",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Once the day’s activities came to a close, the venue was transformed into one of the hottest parties at SXSW with a full line-up of TikTok talent, food, drinks and gifting. Guests were clamoring to get in (including Mark Cuban) -- the line around the block didn’t let up all night, indicating this was the party to be at! @koozebane set the vibe all night long, DJing in between special surprise performances from @sheiskings, @tracy.oj, @keke.janajah, @besperon, and @branmovay. All guests were also gifted a custom, pressed on-site record featuring songs from the TikTok creators who performed that night.</p>"
