  {
   "title": "TikTok LIVE",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>To encourage guests to play with the TikTok LIVE feature, we invited them to Go LIVE with us! Through curated props (along with the mandatory ring light and a custom backdrop), we highlighted five communities distinct to TikTok and helped guests execute a live post to their followers. No TikTok event is complete without showcasing the power of the platform.</p>"
    },
